  "notes": "Reviewed strict specifications for Auxey-Duresses, Monthélie and Maranges. White and red wines are modeled separately at standard and Premier Cru level. Conditional white fermentable-sugar relief to 4 g/L is conservatively fail-closed at the unconditional 3 g/L ceiling. Red accessory white grapes remain mixed-planting exceptions rather than ordinary cellar blend choices.",
